which assigns only while the options file leaves that list unassigned, so
that a write turning every option on, with no UNSET line, would bring it to
life; one where either file holds a line
.Nm
cannot model \(em an assignment to any variable but those two lists and the
.Va _OPTIONS_READ
and
.Va _FILE_COMPLETE_OPTIONS_LIST
that
.Nm make Cm config
writes, a
.Ql !=
whose shell command
