expansion, or any line that is no assignment; and one a port reads none
of, its
.Va OPTIONS_FILE ,
set by
.Pa make.conf
or by its own Makefile, naming a file outside the options directory, since
.Xr make 1
then reads neither the options directory's file nor its
.Pa options.local .
A warning names the file and line, or that
.Va OPTIONS_FILE .
An
.Va OPTIONS_FILE
one entry deep in the options directory is an options file like any other,
read with its
.Pa .local
and written by
.Cm sync
and
.Cm decide :
.Pa devel_git/lite-options ,
which the Makefile of devel/git names for its lite flavor, or another
entry's
.Pa options .
No command writes or removes such a file,
.Cm clean
included; its port shows the options
.Xr make 1
